5,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I’m worried about the silence between us. We need a plan that lets us knock on doors again, not just hide our trash.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Kenji, that’s kind. But I worry about the smell in August. I want to know what living beside this actually feels like daily.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I need to know the hours. Every past arrangement burned out whoever answered the phone first. I want to see the actual workload.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Rin,,One house has had this at their gate for years! I want to check if the new plan is really fair or just quiet.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Servas,,"We must look at the costs. Five households, different budgets. I need to see what this corner already costs us every year.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, fairness is key. If one house suffers, the whole lane suffers. Let’s find a way to share the burden.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I agree. But comfort matters too. I’ll check the residents' meeting statements to see how people felt about the last change.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, feelings are data. I’ll check the ward filing requirements to see how much paperwork this actually takes.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, paperwork is boring! I want to see the truck time. If it comes early, that’s a problem for everyone.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, the truck time is important. I’ll check the block ledger to see what we’ve already spent on fixing this mess.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, the ledger is smart. I’ll check the station block's minutes to see how they handled their own bin house drama.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, their drama is a warning. I’ll check the ward complaint log to see who is actually complaining the most.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, complaints show imbalance. I’ll check the measurements of the five frontages to see if the space is even usable.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, measurements are tricky! I’ll check the truck arrival time from the crew leader to know exactly when the noise starts.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, knowing the time helps. I’ll check the ward subsidy and last year's shelter costs to see if we can afford a fix.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Kenji,,I’m done! I’ll check the station block's minutes and the residents' meeting statements. Let’s see how they kept talking.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I’ll check the ward complaint log and the residents' meeting statements. I want to know who is hurting and why.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Asuka,,I’ll check the ward filing requirements and the measurements of the five frontages. I need to know the real hours and space.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Rin,,I’ll check the truck arrival time and the ward complaint log. I want to know when the truck comes and who is angry.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Servas,,I’ll check the ward subsidy and the block ledger. I need to know the true cost before we commit to anything.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
