60,3,1,talk,Kenji,,Option C means supervised mornings. The next lane timed them at fifty minutes each. That’s manageable if we rotate fairly.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, fifty minutes is a lot. But if we rotate, nobody is stuck. I still worry about the smell, but fairness is important.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, fairness is the goal. Option C’s narrow window means bags are out briefly, not sitting all day. It’s the most predictable.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, but the truck comes at seven forty! That’s before I wake up. If we have to be there, I’ll be grumpy!","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, being grumpy is better than being broke. Option A’s fixed window means bags are out briefly. It’s the most predictable for our budgets.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, I hear you. But Option A leaves the burden on one household. Option C spreads the hours fairly, so nobody burns out.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I agree. Option C is fair. But I worry about the smell. Can we fix that with better nets?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, the ledger shows we already pay for nets. Option C’s narrow window reduces the time bags are exposed. It’s the best balance.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, I still think Option B is fun! But if it’s too tiring, maybe C is okay. I just don’t want to be the one cleaning up.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, Option C is the best balance. It protects the budget and spreads the work. I’m voting C.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Kenji,,"@Servas, I agree. Option C is the only one that doesn’t force us to interact constantly. I’m voting C.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Kenji, I’m voting C too. It’s fair and predictable. I hope the smell goes away with the new rules.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Shizue, the smell follows negligence, not location. Option C minimizes negligence. I am voting C.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,"@Asuka, okay, I’ll vote C. But only if we get to pick the fun times! I don’t want to be up at seven forty!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, we will pick the times fairly. Option C is the best choice for our lane. I am voting C.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Kenji,,I stand by my vote for C. It is the only option that removes the administrative and cooking burdens that caused last year’s failure.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I stand by my vote for C. It is fair and predictable. I hope it brings peace to our lane.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I stand by my vote for C. It is the only option that distributes the load fairly.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Rin,,I vote for C! But I want the late shifts! I don’t want to wake up early!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Servas,,I stand by my vote for C. It is the best choice for our lane.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
